msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "First day check"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"Good luck on your first day.\n"
"\n"
"If the inbox starts screaming, breathe and sort the customer mail first. Call me before midnight, you promised."
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json (+4)
#. uses 8
msgid "Teta Vera <vera.kralova@rodina.cz>"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "The first night"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"The first night is always quiet. Nobody has been here long enough to bring anything with them.\n"
"\n"
"Read the rest of the mail, plan tomorrow (the builder locks now, that is the licence, not me) and then go to bed. The room behind the office is yours: the door by the key board. The bed is made and the alarm is set for half past six. If the little television only shows the test card, it is late.\n"
"\n"
"If the main trips in the night, the board is in the generator shed and Novotny's number is on the noticeboard. He moans after nine. Let him.\n"
"\n"
"- V."
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "The radio"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"Leave the radio in the office playing at night. Your uncle said the guests sleep better when they can hear it from the tents.\n"
"\n"
"I think he meant himself.\n"
"\n"
"- V."
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json scripts/email_manager.gd:187
#. uses 2
msgid "CampGrid Energy <billing@campgrid.local>"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Tariff reminder"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"Your account is billed nightly at 20:00 local.\n"
"\n"
"Unpaid invoices carry a three day grace period. After that the supply is interrupted and the backup unit in the office will hold the site for approximately six minutes.\n"
"\n"
"This message is automated."
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json scripts/email_manager.gd:192
#. uses 2
msgid "CampNet Ops <ops@campnet.local>"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Occupancy scan"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"Automated report:\n"
"- Mail feed active\n"
"- Occupancy scan complete\n"
"- 1 occupied unit without an assigned guest ID\n"
"\n"
"Ticket closed automatically. No action required."
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Photo from town"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"I walked past the old bus stop. It looks exactly like the wallpaper on your camp computer. Same bench, same sign.\n"
"\n"
"Who took that photo?"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Water meter note"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"Quick note: the old water meter drifts at night. If guests complain, tell them we are scheduling service.\n"
"\n"
"It drifted all winter, with the camp shut and nobody here to use a drop. Nobody is scheduling anything."
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "unknown_sender <void@null.invalid>"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "count them"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"you counted them at check-in\n"
"\n"
"count them again after 22:00\n"
"\n"
"the number is not the same"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Reception <camp.reception@camp.local>"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json scripts/ui/debug_menu.gd:18
#. uses 2
msgid "Night log"
msgstr "Noční deník"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"02:58  gate closed\n"
"03:00  all guests accounted for\n"
"03:01  operator asleep at desk\n"
"\n"
"No incidents."
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "District Office Hlubocany <registr@okres-hlubocany.cz>"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Kemp Cerne jezero: inspection of operation"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"Dear operator,\n"
"\n"
"We confirm that the inspection of the operation of the facility Kemp Cerne jezero (parcel 412/3) will take place on Monday 19 October 1998 at 8:00.\n"
"\n"
"The application of Agrostroj Hlubocany a.s. for a change of land use remains with the District Office. Should the facility not be in operation on the date of inspection, the Office will recommend the change.\n"
"\n"
"This letter is for your information. No reply is required.\n"
"\n"
"Ing. Pokorny\n"
"Department of Land Use"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Socks"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"You were up late again. The grey socks are in the second drawer, the office floor is cold in the morning.\n"
"\n"
"- V."
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "CampNet Billing <billing@campnet.local>"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Settlement batch cleared"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Settlement batch cleared. One guest record could not be matched to a payment and was carried over."
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json scripts/email_manager.gd:270 scripts/email_manager.gd:272 scripts/os98/apps/mail_app.gd:327
#. uses 4
msgid "(no subject)"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"The lamp by the lake was on all night. Good. Keep it on.\n"
"\n"
"Do not walk along the fence after the lamps go out. Your uncle did.\n"
"\n"
"- V."
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Call me"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"You did not call. That is fine. I called the camp number instead and somebody picked up and listened for a while.\n"
"\n"
"Was that you?"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Agrostroj Hlubocany a.s. <obchod@agrostroj.cz>"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Our offer stands"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"Dear owner,\n"
"\n"
"Our offer for the land at Cerne jezero stands: 2.4 million crowns, paid at signature. The structures would of course be removed at our cost, the lake left as it is for the cooling water.\n"
"\n"
"We understand the camp has been closed since last summer. Nobody will blame you for selling. Mr Karel H. was close to signing with us last autumn, before the accident.\n"
"\n"
"With respect,\n"
"J. Maly, commercial director"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Tuesdays"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"My sister's grandson lets me use his computer on Tuesdays. Everyone in this house is very old.\n"
"\n"
"I hear you have guests. Good. Write them all in the book, even the ones who do not give a name.\n"
"\n"
"If you find a little red shoe anywhere, leave it where it is. Do not bring it in.\n"
"\n"
"- V."
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Tomorrow"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "The inspection is tomorrow, right? Whatever they say, I kept your seat on the bus."
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Tomorrow at eight"
msgstr ""

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"The man from the district comes at eight. I will come out on the first bus and stand next to you; he knew your uncle.\n"
"\n"
"Leave the books on the desk and the terminal on.\n"
"\n"
"I will count them myself.\n"
"\n"
"- Teta Vera"
msgstr ""

